  "description": "Reid Sphere WSD | Commuter city bike\nComfortable, capable and built for everyday journeys – a versatile commuter bike designed for city streets, cycle paths and longer rides.\nThe Reid Bikes Sphere WSD is designed for comfortable everyday commuting, combining a lightweight 6061 alloy frame with WSD-specific geometry for a confident, controlled ride. A steel rigid fork adds stability, while internal cable routing keeps the frame clean and helps protect cables from everyday wear.\nKenda 27.5\" x 2.2\" tan-wall tyres provide plenty of grip and cushioning across urban roads, cycle paths and mixed surfaces, while 27.5\" double-wall alloy rims offer a durable setup for regular riding.\nA Shimano 2x8-speed drivetrain gives you a wide range of gears for flat roads, hills and longer commutes. Tektro hydraulic disc brakes provide smooth, reliable stopping power and confident control in changing conditions.\nComfort is built into the Reid Bikes Sphere WSD bike, with ergonomic grips and a comfort saddle helping make longer journeys more enjoyable. Integrated mudguards add practical protection from road spray, making the Reid Sphere WSD well suited to everyday commuting and year-round riding.\nWith three frame sizes – 38cm, 42cm and 46cm – the Reid Bikes Sphere WSD bike offers a more compact fit for riders who prefer a smaller frame and WSD-specific geometry.\nThe Reid Bikes Sphere WSD bike is ideal for:\n\nEveryday commuters looking for a comfortable and reliable bike for getting to work\n\nCity and urban riding, with responsive handling and stable 27.5\" wheels\n\nLonger commutes, with Shimano 2x8-speed gearing for tackling hills and varied terrain\n\nRiders who want extra comfort, with wider 2.2\" tyres, ergonomic grips and a comfort saddle\n\nAll-weather commuting, with integrated mudguards and hydraulic disc brakes\n\nRiders tackling mixed surfaces, from roads and cycle paths to smoother trails\n\nRiders looking for a more compact fit, with WSD-specific geometry and three smaller frame sizes\n\nVersatile everyday riding, suitable for commuting, errands and weekend rides",
